9. RESULTS AND EVALUATION
9.1 Fraud Detection Results
On the 200,000-row IEEE-CIS fraud training run, XGBoost achieved
ROC-AUC 0.9411 and average precision 0.6796. The combined
XGBoost and Isolation Forest score achieved ROC-AUC 0.9373.
The results show that the platform can handle the richer IEEE-CIS
feature schema while maintaining strong fraud discrimination
performance.

