10. DEPLOYMENT AND DEMONSTRATION
The project runs locally with two processes: a FastAPI server on port
8000 and a Streamlit dashboard on port 8501. The dashboard verifies
API availability through the /health endpoint and displays “API
Connected” when the backend is active. The project was moved to the
D drive for more reliable handling of large datasets and model artifacts.
For demonstrations, single-record prediction is recommended. Batch
prediction is supported, but full IEEE-CIS files should not be uploaded
directly during a live demo because the current dashboard processes
rows sequentially.

